  (no_connect (at 50.8 63.5) (uuid 4b27a5de-1436-5423-a786-e24d738f8f32))
  (text "AUTHORITATIVE for connectivity. The part notes are on each part's Note field.\n\nITS SUPPLY IS U-ISO'S ISOLATED 12 V (ADR 0027): ISO_POS12 and PWR_GND, from module/power-entry. Until 2026-09-30\nthe load switch hung on the bus +12 V and power-entry.md's entry drawing showed it; that drawing now stops at\nISO_POS12, and umbilical-load-switch.md draws the gate network and the ON divider.\n\n[SENSE_NODE] The sense resistor's far end IS the FET drain, and the pin that watches it.\n\n[GATE_COMP_MID] R-GATE-COMP and C-GATE in SERIES to ground. The series pair is the compensation zero; the\ncapacitor alone is not.\n\n[ON, ON_SW] The UVLO divider R-ON-HI / R-ON-LO from ISO_POS12, with SW-POWER in its top leg: closed, ON\nsits at 10/78 of the supply and trips at 10.2 V rising, 9.6 V falling; open, R-ON-LO holds ON at 0 V (OFF).\nCycling the toggle is the ON pulse that restores the -1 after a latch. C-ON-LOADSW is the datasheet's 0.1 uF.\n\n[GATE_NODE] D-GATE-CLAMP holds the FET's gate-source below its 20 V rating: GATE can sit 18 V above VCC.\n\n[PWRGD] PWRGD IS NOT USED, and an open-drain output left open is harmless. The panel LED reads the load\nswitch's output instead (module/panel-led), which says the same thing - lit = delivering, dark = off or latched." (at 408.94 38.099999999999994 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3e09ec79-e312-5333-a8e2-c8aea047f8bf))
  (wire (pts (xy 147.32 187.96) (xy 149.86 187.96)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid 78cc0783-944f-4ea1-8abb-40dd5dee3984))
